cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  OptunaSharp is a .NET port of Optuna. If you use OptunaSharp in academic work, please also cite the
  original Optuna paper (see the reference below).
title: "OptunaSharp: A .NET port of Optuna"
abstract: >-
  OptunaSharp brings Optuna's define-by-run hyperparameter optimization framework — studies, trials,
  samplers, pruners, distributions, and storages — to the .NET platform (C#/F#), built on top of
  NumSharp. Optuna is treated as the behavioral source of truth.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "SciSharp STACK Team and OptunaSharp contributors"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/SciSharp/OptunaSharp"
url: "https://github.com/SciSharp/OptunaSharp"
keywords:
  - hyperparameter-optimization
  - optuna
  - automl
  - dotnet
  - csharp
  - machine-learning
  - scisharp
references:
